       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      *****************************************************************
      * CABONL01 - CAB0 MENU / DISPATCHER                             *
      * APPLICATION : CABS (ONLINE)                                   *
      * COMPILER    : ENTERPRISE COBOL                                *
      * TRANSACTION : CAB0                                            *
      * MAPSET      : CABM01 / MENUMAP                    CABM0100    *
      * TARGETS     : CABONL02 CAB1  CARRIER (OCN) INQUIRY            *
      *               CABONL03 CAB2  INVOICE INQUIRY                  *
      *               CABONL04 CAB3  FACTOR MAINTENANCE                *
      *               CABONL05 CAB4  DISPUTE ENTRY                    *
      *               CABONL06 CAB5  SETTLEMENT INQUIRY                *
      * COMMAREA    : CABSCOMM - PUSHES A NAV STACK ENTRY BEFORE       *
      *               EVERY XCTL SO A LOWER SCREEN CAN RETURN HERE.    *
      * RUNNABLE    : REFERENCE-ONLY.  MVS 3.8J / TK4- CARRIES NO      *
      *               CICS REGION.  SEE ONLINE/_MANIFEST.MD.           *
      * REVISION HISTORY                                                *
      *   V1.00  1991-04-02  R.KESSLER    INITIAL - FOUR OPTIONS       *
      *   V1.01  1994-11-18  R.KESSLER    OPTION 5 SETTLEMENT ADDED    *
      *   V1.02  1998-06-01  D.OYELARAN   OPTION 6 REPORTS MENU ADDED  *
      *                                   (CABONL07, RUN AGAINST THE   *
      *                                   OLD PRINT SPOOL SUBSYSTEM)   *
      *   V1.03  2003-09-12  D.OYELARAN   OPTION 6 WITHDRAWN - REPORTS *
      *                                   MOVED TO THE MVS BATCH        *
      *                                   REPORT DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM   *
      *   V1.04  2011-06-09  M.OYELARAN   RECOMPILE ONLY                *
      *   V1.05  2018-02-27  K.VANCE      RESP CHECK ADDED ON XCTL     *
      *                                   PER CABS-STD-014 REV 2       *
      *****************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID.    CABONL01.
       AUTHOR.        R.KESSLER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  1991-04-02.
       DATE-COMPILED.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  WS-PROGRAM-IDENT.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME              PIC X(08) VALUE 'CABONL01'.
           05  WS-PGM-VERSION           PIC X(05) VALUE 'V1.05'.
           05  WS-PGM-TRANID            PIC X(04) VALUE 'CAB0'.

      * SYSTEM DATE/TIME - REFRESHED EVERY INBOUND ENTRY SO THE MENU
      * ALWAYS SHOWS THE CURRENT CLOCK, NOT THE CLOCK AT FIRST ENTRY.
       01  WS-DATE-TIME-AREA.
           05  WS-ABSTIME               PIC S9(15) COMP-3.
           05  WS-DISP-DATE             PIC X(08).
           05  WS-DISP-TIME             PIC X(08).

      * MENU OPTION EDIT WORK.
       01  WS-EDIT-WORK.
           05  WS-OPTION                PIC 9(02) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-OPTION-OK-SW          PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-OPTION-OK             VALUE 'Y'.

      * THE 1998 REPORTS OPTION WAS SIX ON THIS MENU.  THE SWITCH
      * REMAINS HERE UNTIL THE PANEL INVENTORY REVIEW (CABS-STD-009)
      * CONFIRMS NO DOWNSTREAM JCL SYMBOLIC STILL TESTS FOR IT.
       01  WS-RPT-MENU-SW               PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           88  WS-RPT-MENU-ACTIVE           VALUE 'Y'.

      * TARGET PROGRAM TABLE - OPTION NUMBER TO PROGRAM/TRANID.
       01  WS-TARGET-TABLE.
           05  FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE 'CABONL02CAB1S02 '.
           05  FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE 'CABONL03CAB2S02 '.
           05  FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE 'CABONL04CAB3S02 '.
           05  FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE 'CABONL05CAB4S02 '.
           05  FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE 'CABONL06CAB5S02 '.
       01  WS-TARGET-REDEF REDEFINES WS-TARGET-TABLE.
           05  WS-TGT-ENTRY OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY WS-TGT-IX.
               10  WS-TGT-PGM           PIC X(08).
               10  WS-TGT-TRANID        PIC X(04).
               10  WS-TGT-MAP           PIC X(04).

      * CICS RESP AREAS - THIS PROGRAM USES OLD-STYLE HANDLE
      * CONDITION FOR THE MAP I/O BUT CHECKS RESP EXPLICITLY ON THE
      * XCTL SINCE THE 2018 CHANGE (V1.05).  BOTH STYLES COEXIST -
      * SEE CABS-STD-014.
       01  WS-RESP-AREA.
           05  WS-RESP                  PIC S9(08) COMP.
           05  WS-RESP2                 PIC S9(08) COMP.

       01  WS-MSG-AREA                  PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.

           COPY DFHAID.
           COPY DFHBMSCA.

      * SYMBOLIC MAP - GENERATED BY THE TYPE=DSECT ASSEMBLY OF
      * CABM0100 (SEE ONLINE/BMS/CABMAPS.JCL) INTO THE COPYBOOK
      * LIBRARY.  NOT PHYSICALLY PRESENT IN SOURCE CONTROL.
           COPY CABM0100.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY CABSCOMM
               REPLACING ==CABS-COMM-AREA== BY ==DFHCOMMAREA==.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       P0000-MAINLINE.
           EXEC CICS HANDLE CONDITION
                MAPFAIL    (P2900-MAPFAIL-HANDLER)
                ERROR      (P9000-ABEND-HANDLER)
           END-EXEC.

           IF EIBCALEN = ZERO
               PERFORM P1000-FIRST-ENTRY THRU P1000-EXIT
           ELSE
               PERFORM P2000-PROCESS-INPUT THRU P2000-EXIT
           END-IF

           GOBACK.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P1000 - FIRST ENTRY.  NO COMMAREA WAS PASSED IN, SO         *
      * DFHCOMMAREA IS NOT YET ADDRESSABLE - OPERATOR JUST LOGGED  *
      * ON OR CLEARED BACK TO CAB0 FROM SOMEWHERE THAT DID NOT     *
      * CARRY CONTEXT FORWARD.  GETMAIN A FRESH COMMAREA AND        *
      * INITIALISE IT.                                              *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P1000-FIRST-ENTRY.
           EXEC CICS GETMAIN
                SET(ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA)
                FLENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
           END-EXEC.
           INITIALIZE DFHCOMMAREA.
           MOVE ZERO             TO CM-NAV-DEPTH.
           MOVE SPACES           TO CM-RETURN-TO.
           MOVE EIBTRMID          TO CM-TERMID.
           MOVE 'CAB0USER'       TO CM-USERID.
           PERFORM P1500-BUILD-CLOCK THRU P1500-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACES            TO WS-MSG-AREA.
           PERFORM P1800-SEND-MENU THRU P1800-EXIT.
           EXEC CICS RETURN
                TRANSID('CAB0')
                COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
           END-EXEC.
       P1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P1500 - BUILD DATE/TIME FOR THE SCREEN CLOCK.              *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P1500-BUILD-CLOCK.
           EXEC CICS ASKTIME
                ABSTIME(WS-ABSTIME)
           END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS FORMATTIME
                ABSTIME(WS-ABSTIME)
                MMDDYYYY(WS-DISP-DATE)
                TIME(WS-DISP-TIME)
           END-EXEC.
           MOVE WS-DISP-DATE      TO CM-WORK-DATE.
           MOVE WS-DISP-TIME      TO CM-WORK-TIME.
       P1500-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P1800 - SEND THE MENU MAP, FULL ERASE.                     *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P1800-SEND-MENU.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES        TO MENUMAPO.
           MOVE CM-WORK-DATE      TO CDATO.
           MOVE CM-WORK-TIME      TO CTIMO.
           MOVE CM-USERID         TO USIDO.
           MOVE WS-MSG-AREA       TO MSGLO.
           EXEC CICS SEND MAP('MENUMAP')
                MAPSET('CABM01')
                FROM(MENUMAPO)
                ERASE
                CURSOR
           END-EXEC.
       P1800-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P2000 - AN AID KEY OR ENTER CAME BACK.  PF3/PF12/CLEAR     *
      * TERMINATE THE CONVERSATION.  ANYTHING ELSE IS TREATED AS   *
      * A REQUEST TO RECEIVE THE OPTION FIELD.                     *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P2000-PROCESS-INPUT.
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN EIBAID = DFHCLEAR
                   PERFORM P1500-BUILD-CLOCK THRU P1500-EXIT
                   MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM P1800-SEND-MENU THRU P1800-EXIT
                   EXEC CICS RETURN
                        TRANSID('CAB0')
                        COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                        LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
                   END-EXEC
               WHEN EIBAID = DFHPF3
                   PERFORM P8100-TERMINATE THRU P8100-EXIT
               WHEN EIBAID = DFHPF12
                   PERFORM P4900-POP-NAV-STACK THRU P4900-EXIT
                   PERFORM P1500-BUILD-CLOCK THRU P1500-EXIT
                   MOVE 'NAVIGATION CANCELLED' TO WS-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM P1800-SEND-MENU THRU P1800-EXIT
                   EXEC CICS RETURN
                        TRANSID('CAB0')
                        COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                        LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
                   END-EXEC
               WHEN OTHER
                   PERFORM P2200-RECEIVE-OPTION THRU P2200-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
       P2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P2200 - RECEIVE THE OPTION FIELD AND EDIT IT.              *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P2200-RECEIVE-OPTION.
           EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('MENUMAP')
                MAPSET('CABM01')
                INTO(MENUMAPI)
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE 'N' TO WS-OPTION-OK-SW.
           IF OPTL > ZERO
               MOVE OPTI TO WS-OPTION
               IF WS-OPTION >= 1 AND WS-OPTION <= 5
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OPTION-OK-SW
               END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF WS-OPTION-OK
               PERFORM P4000-DISPATCH THRU P4000-EXIT
           ELSE
               MOVE 'INVALID OPTION - ENTER 1 THRU 5' TO WS-MSG-AREA
               PERFORM P1500-BUILD-CLOCK THRU P1500-EXIT
               MOVE WS-MSG-AREA TO MSGLO
               EXEC CICS SEND MAP('MENUMAP')
                    MAPSET('CABM01')
                    FROM(MENUMAPO)
                    DATAONLY
                    ALARM
                    CURSOR
               END-EXEC
               EXEC CICS RETURN
                    TRANSID('CAB0')
                    COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                    LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
               END-EXEC
           END-IF.
       P2200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P2900 - MAPFAIL HANDLER.  OPERATOR PRESSED ENTER WITH THE  *
      * OPTION FIELD UNTOUCHED AND THE FIELD LEFT AT ITS INITIAL   *
      * (NULL) STATE.  REDISPLAY RATHER THAN ABEND.                *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P2900-MAPFAIL-HANDLER.
           MOVE 'ENTER AN OPTION NUMBER' TO WS-MSG-AREA.
           PERFORM P1500-BUILD-CLOCK THRU P1500-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG-AREA TO MSGLO.
           EXEC CICS SEND MAP('MENUMAP')
                MAPSET('CABM01')
                FROM(MENUMAPO)
                DATAONLY
                CURSOR
           END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS RETURN
                TRANSID('CAB0')
                COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
           END-EXEC.
       P2900-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P4000 - DISPATCH TO THE SELECTED TRANSACTION.  PUSHES A    *
      * NAV STACK ENTRY, SETS CM-RETURN-TO, AND XCTLS.             *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P4000-DISPATCH.
           SET WS-TGT-IX TO WS-OPTION.
           MOVE 'CAB0'             TO CM-RETURN-TO.
           MOVE SPACES             TO CM-MSG-TEXT.
           PERFORM P4100-PUSH-NAV-STACK THRU P4100-EXIT.

           EXEC CICS XCTL
                PROGRAM(WS-TGT-PGM(WS-TGT-IX))
                COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
                RESP(WS-RESP)
           END-EXEC.

      * XCTL DOES NOT RETURN ON SUCCESS.  ARRIVING HERE MEANS THE
      * TARGET PROGRAM COULD NOT BE LOADED - RARE, BUT THE 2018
      * CHANGE ADDED THE EXPLICIT CHECK AFTER A NEWCOPY MISMATCH
      * ON CABONL04 WENT UNNOTICED FOR A WEEKEND.
           IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
               MOVE 'REQUESTED FUNCTION UNAVAILABLE - TRY AGAIN'
                    TO WS-MSG-AREA
               PERFORM P1500-BUILD-CLOCK THRU P1500-EXIT
               MOVE WS-MSG-AREA TO MSGLO
               EXEC CICS SEND MAP('MENUMAP')
                    MAPSET('CABM01')
                    FROM(MENUMAPO)
                    DATAONLY
                    ALARM
                    CURSOR
               END-EXEC
               EXEC CICS RETURN
                    TRANSID('CAB0')
                    COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                    LENGTH(LENGTH OF DFHCOMMAREA)
               END-EXEC
           END-IF.
       P4000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P4100 - PUSH ONE ENTRY ONTO THE FOUR DEEP NAV STACK.  A    *
      * STACK ALREADY AT DEPTH 4 IS SHIFTED DOWN AND ENTRY 1 IS    *
      * LOST - THE MENU IS ALWAYS RECOVERABLE SO THIS IS ACCEPTED. *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P4100-PUSH-NAV-STACK.
           IF CM-NAV-DEPTH >= 4
               MOVE CM-NS-PGM(2) TO CM-NS-PGM(1)
               MOVE CM-NS-MAP(2) TO CM-NS-MAP(1)
               MOVE CM-NS-KEY(2) TO CM-NS-KEY(1)
               MOVE CM-NS-PGM(3) TO CM-NS-PGM(2)
               MOVE CM-NS-MAP(3) TO CM-NS-MAP(2)
               MOVE CM-NS-KEY(3) TO CM-NS-KEY(2)
               MOVE CM-NS-PGM(4) TO CM-NS-PGM(3)
               MOVE CM-NS-MAP(4) TO CM-NS-MAP(3)
               MOVE CM-NS-KEY(4) TO CM-NS-KEY(3)
               MOVE 'CABONL01'   TO CM-NS-PGM(4)
               MOVE 'MENUMAP'    TO CM-NS-MAP(4)
               MOVE SPACES       TO CM-NS-KEY(4)
           ELSE
               ADD 1 TO CM-NAV-DEPTH
               MOVE 'CABONL01' TO CM-NS-PGM(CM-NAV-DEPTH)
               MOVE 'MENUMAP'  TO CM-NS-MAP(CM-NAV-DEPTH)
               MOVE SPACES     TO CM-NS-KEY(CM-NAV-DEPTH)
           END-IF.
       P4100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P4900 - POP THE TOP NAV STACK ENTRY.  PF12 AT THE MENU     *
      * MEANS THE OPERATOR WANTS TO ABANDON WHATEVER CHAIN OF      *
      * SCREENS LED BACK HERE WITHOUT ENDING THE SESSION - DROP    *
      * THE MOST RECENT ENTRY SO THE NEXT DISPATCH STARTS CLEAN.   *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P4900-POP-NAV-STACK.
           IF CM-NAV-DEPTH > 0
               MOVE SPACES TO CM-NS-PGM(CM-NAV-DEPTH)
               MOVE SPACES TO CM-NS-MAP(CM-NAV-DEPTH)
               MOVE SPACES TO CM-NS-KEY(CM-NAV-DEPTH)
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM CM-NAV-DEPTH
           END-IF.
       P4900-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P8100 - PF3 FROM THE MENU ENDS THE CONVERSATION.           *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P8100-TERMINATE.
           EXEC CICS SEND TEXT
                FROM('CABS ONLINE SESSION ENDED')
                LENGTH(25)
                ERASE
                FREEKB
           END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS RETURN
           END-EXEC.
       P8100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      * P9000 - GENERIC ERROR HANDLER FOR ANY UNHANDLED CICS       *
      * CONDITION RAISED WHILE THIS TRANSACTION IS IN CONTROL.     *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
       P9000-ABEND-HANDLER.
           MOVE EIBRESP  TO WS-RESP.
           MOVE EIBRESP2 TO WS-RESP2.
           EXEC CICS ABEND
                ABCODE('CB01')
           END-EXEC.
       P9000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
